{
  "title": { "zh": "规则作用于假设" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到这里用过的规则都看目标：结论对上目标，前提成为新目标。拆解写成规则是 ⟦?A ∧ ?B; ⟦?A; ?B⟧ ⟹ ?C⟧ ⟹ ?C：结论 ?C 对得上任何目标，第一条前提 ?A ∧ ?B 却无法从目标读出，成了一个全是 ? 的目标。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "规则从板上的「规则」输入接入；设计出的证明助手会成为新元件<part-ref to=\"lemma:erule\"></part-ref>，这个输入就是它的「规则」口。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-elim",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "becomes",
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } },
        { "name": "rules", "label": { "zh": "规则" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "goal": "Wind ∧ Rain",
          "hyps": ["Rain ∧ Wind"],
          "rules": ["conjE"],
          "becomes": [["Rain ∧ Wind; Rain; Wind ⊢ Wind ∧ Rain"]]
        },
        { "goal": "Slip", "hyps": ["Wet ∧ Slip"], "rules": ["conjE"], "becomes": [["Wet ∧ Slip; Wet; Slip ⊢ Slip"]] },
        {
          "goal": "Wind ∧ Wet",
          "hyps": ["Rain", "Wet ∧ Wind"],
          "rules": ["conjE"],
          "becomes": [["Rain; Wet ∧ Wind; Wet; Wind ⊢ Wind ∧ Wet"]]
        }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：拆开「并且」那条已知，把每个目标变成要的样子。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "全是 ? 的目标，什么能确定它？" },
        {
          "zh": "倒着用规则之后，紧接着用<part-ref to=\"part:assumption\"></part-ref>。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["c0 = rule(in, rules)", "c1 = assumption(c0)", "out <- c1"]
    }
  ]
}
